The disappointment comes possibly from the fact, that luckstones are not
that uncommon in the mines - I think that in some 50% of my games I actually
find a luckstone before I reach the bottom of the mines. Sure, there are
other gems there as well, but those you can find elsewhere as well. So in
those games I have no reason to explore the mines to the bottom - except for
all the random scrolls and other item scattered there. Now, if luckstones 
were a bit less common - well... 

For the usefulness of a luckstones - well, in 3.0 it was very high on my
list of wishes (sometimes my first wish was for a luckstone) - now, with
the mines I don't need to waste a wish any more...

